; BIND zone file for ttllms.com
; Import in Cloudflare: ttllms.com → DNS → Import and Export → Upload BIND
; Points apex + www at Cloudflare Pages project "ttllms"
; Contact: md@0265.au

$ORIGIN ttllms.com.
$TTL 3600

; Primary site (Cloudflare Pages)
@       IN  CNAME   ttllms.pages.dev.
www     IN  CNAME   ttllms.pages.dev.
